{"unit_id":"DDDFXYqiming__dsh-session-recap#card-zh","repo":"DDDFXYqiming/dsh-session-recap","commit":"ee088dcc078a85ab10745d47516c63dfa8e0292f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-recap 是 DSH Web 会话回顾插件：用户离开一段时间后，它根据会话进度生成简短摘要，并在返回时显示在输入框上方。插件跟踪 Web 客户端状态和已完成回合，在满足空闲时长、回合数和文本量条件时调用会话可用的模型路由；也可通过 /recap 手动生成。摘要包含当前任务、关键进展和下一步，保存在插件侧车文件中，不写入会话消息。适合需要离开后快速恢复工作上下文的 DSH 用户；自动回顾需要 Web 客户端和可用模型路由。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:931-1035","src/client.js:416-419"]}
{"unit_id":"DDDFXYqiming__dsh-session-recap#card-en","repo":"DDDFXYqiming/dsh-session-recap","commit":"ee088dcc078a85ab10745d47516c63dfa8e0292f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-recap adds short away recaps to DSH Web sessions. After idle and conversation thresholds are met, it summarizes the task, progress, and next action using the session model route. The recap appears above the composer when you return; /recap also creates one on demand.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:931-1035","src/client.js:416-419"]}
