{"unit_id":"DDDFXYqiming__dsh-session-recap#feature-1","repo":"DDDFXYqiming/dsh-session-recap","commit":"ee088dcc078a85ab10745d47516c63dfa8e0292f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-session-recap** 的功能「自动离开回顾」：当所有已连接的 Web 客户端持续处于离开状态，且会话达到空闲时长、已完成回合数和文本量门槛时，插件调用模型生成摘要；回顾展示当前任务、重要进展和下一步。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:966-979","src/index.ts:530-575"]}
{"unit_id":"DDDFXYqiming__dsh-session-recap#feature-2","repo":"DDDFXYqiming/dsh-session-recap","commit":"ee088dcc078a85ab10745d47516c63dfa8e0292f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-session-recap** 的功能「手动生成回顾」：用户可从 Web 斜杠菜单运行 /recap，按需为当前会话生成摘要；也可启用 hostCommand，在没有 Web 客户端的 profile 中注册主机命令。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:399-414","src/index.ts:1014-1021"]}
{"unit_id":"DDDFXYqiming__dsh-session-recap#feature-3","repo":"DDDFXYqiming/dsh-session-recap","commit":"ee088dcc078a85ab10745d47516c63dfa8e0292f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-session-recap** 的功能「返回会话查看摘要」：插件将当前回顾显示在会话输入框上方，用户可以关闭提示；客户端轮询主机端点获取会话快照。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:275-305","src/client.js:416-419"]}
{"unit_id":"DDDFXYqiming__dsh-session-recap#feature-4","repo":"DDDFXYqiming/dsh-session-recap","commit":"ee088dcc078a85ab10745d47516c63dfa8e0292f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-session-recap** 的功能「摘要持久化与长度控制」：主机将摘要保存到插件数据目录的侧车文件，并对输入 transcript 字节数、模型输出 token 和最终摘要字符数设上限。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:82-100","src/index.ts:530-575"]}
{"unit_id":"DDDFXYqiming__dsh-session-recap#caveat-zh","repo":"DDDFXYqiming/dsh-session-recap","commit":"ee088dcc078a85ab10745d47516c63dfa8e0292f","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-recap 使用会话当前可用的模型路由生成摘要，并把 transcript 内容发送给该模型；需要确保会话模型路由可用。固定路由可同时配置 provider 和 model。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:530-560","src/index.ts:94-95"]}
